    "detailed_description": "FawnRun <br />\r\nA casual mini-game with very simple controls.<br />\r\nYou'll need to focus on dodging all moving objects and successfully picking up random fawn icons, up to 100!<br />\r\nThe screen you see is the only level of the game, there are no upgrades, no more levels, no tight time requirements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nA/D: Control movement<br />\r\nW: Control the jump<br />\r\nESC: Pause the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: Please be patient, calm, and move actively.If you can't pick up the fawn icon in the first place, don't worry about it, because the icon will reappear in a certain position in a short time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnd Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Hit any moving object!<br />\r\n2. Close the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Collect 100 fawn icons!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun!",
    "about_the_game": "FawnRun <br />\r\nA casual mini-game with very simple controls.<br />\r\nYou'll need to focus on dodging all moving objects and successfully picking up random fawn icons, up to 100!<br />\r\nThe screen you see is the only level of the game, there are no upgrades, no more levels, no tight time requirements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nA/D: Control movement<br />\r\nW: Control the jump<br />\r\nESC: Pause the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: Please be patient, calm, and move actively.If you can't pick up the fawn icon in the first place, don't worry about it, because the icon will reappear in a certain position in a short time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnd Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Hit any moving object!<br />\r\n2. Close the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Collect 100 fawn icons!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun!",
